    "title": "The AKU Inter-Medical College Cricket Tournament 2001",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "The Sports Committee of Aga Khan University Medical College organized its 2nd Cricket Tournament in the months of April and May 2001.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "571ba7c74ee65cde",
